        },
        {
          "text": "Je! Mbegu ingali ghalani? Naam, huo mzabibu, wala mtini, wala mkomamanga, wala mzeituni, haikuzaa kitu; tangu siku hii ya leo nitawabariki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.19",
